So you may recall after recursive flip I started being able to hear these deep metallic sounding thumbs like a thick thick metal string being strum. Sometimes above my eyeline (inside my head obviously) sometimes to the left. Well last night I heard one but it had WORDS inside it. I couldn’t catch the words. 